{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10131070","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10131070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1013107001:0":{"text":"そちらの騎士のお兄さん！ずいぶんと立派な羽冠ですねぇ！最上級の金属保護液はいかがです？","source_cn":"这位骑士大哥，您头顶的翼冠实在亮眼！我们这有最好的金属...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98D819B584F4EC4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013107002:0":{"text":"見る目がありますね！では三本……いや、さすがに多いか……二本ください！","source_cn":"眼光不错嘛，给我来三瓶——啊，好像多了点，就先来两瓶吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD864C2492C3B9A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013107003:0":{"text":"ここの商人たちは今まで見てきたブラックゴールドの悪者と少し違う気がしますね……","source_cn":"这些黑金商人和我们见过的那些黑金坏蛋，好像不太一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x283FBA265C331996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013107004:0":{"text":"商人は利益が第一だ。儲け話の前では態度も変わる。ここで少し調査していこう。","source_cn":"商人是逐利之人，以利诱之就有道理可讲。在此处调查一番吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA66E6673E210420B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"商人は利益が第一だ。儲け話の前では態度も変わる。ここで少し調査していこう。","female":"商人は利益が第一だもの。儲け話の前では態度も変わるわ。ここで少し調査していきましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"114384","variant_female_record_index":"114385","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:活泼的黑金小贩":{"text":"陽気な行商人","source":"活泼的黑金小贩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"ルシウス","s